meta {
  name: Get Recently Reminder
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/reminder/recently
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Recently Reminder

  This request is used to get recently reminder (3 days ago) history with pagination. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — reminder fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `remind_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "reminder fetched",
    "data": {
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "28668090-5653-dff5-2d8f-af603fc36b45",
          "reminder_title": "Routine service",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1610 ZBC",
          "reminder_context": "Service",
          "reminder_body": "Lorem ipsum",
          "remind_at": "2025-06-24 10:54:42"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — reminder failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "reminder history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}